   230→	/**
   231→	 * @brief Determine whether the adaptor supports write seeking.
   232→	 * 
   233→	 * This is determined at compile-time and does not need to checked at
   234→	 * run-time.
   235→	 * 
   236→	 * @return True if write seeking is supported, otherwise false.
